      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "숙소로 돌아가던 길에 짐을 한아름 든 뮤리엘과 마주쳤다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "宿への帰り道、大荷物を抱えたミュリエルに遭遇した。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아, 단장! 마침 잘 나타났어!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あっ、団長！ちょうど良かったわ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "StartFxSoundName": "SFX_BATTLE_COMMON_CLOTH_16.wav",
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "CameraOffset": "ONE_3",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "혹시 불우한 이웃에게 선행을 베풀어 주지 않을래?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "困ってる人に手を差し伸べる気はない？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이 짐을 나 대신 NOA 지부까지 가져가 주기만 하면 돼.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "この荷物を、うちの代わりにNOA支部まで運んでくれさえすればいいんだけど。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "거절할게.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "お断りするよ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "뭐어? 이렇게 연약하고 가녀린 소녀가 하는 부탁인데?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "何よ？か弱い少女がお願いしてるのに？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "양손을 못 쓰는 동안 스타피어서를 훔쳐갈 테니까.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "両手が塞がってる間に、スターピアサーを盗まれるからな。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "CameraOffset": "DEFAULT",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "체엣…. 눈치가 빠르네.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ちぇっ…察しがいいのね。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "그 짐도 날 속이려고 준비한 거야?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "その荷物も、私を騙そうと思って用意したの？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "응? 이거?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "うん？これのこと？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 18,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "후후, 단장. 자의식이 강하네.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ふふ、団長。自意識過剰なのね。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "오늘 단장이랑 마주친 건 사소한 우연이라구.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "今日団長に会ったのは、ただの偶然よ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
